          <w:color w:val="000000"/>
          <w:sz w:val="22"/>
          <w:szCs w:val="22"/>
        </w:rPr>
        <w:t xml:space="preserve"> at 100% achievement. Payout is discretionary, linked to Company, business unit and individual performance, and is paid annually in arrears. You must be on the rolls and not serving notice on the payout date to be eligible. Variable pay in your first year is pro-rated from your date of joining.</w:t>
